%=====================================================================
%  refs.bib --- Advanced Research Methodology (MS IT / PhD IT)
%
%  This file is part of the teaching material, not just build plumbing:
%  students are expected to import it into Zotero or JabRef and grow it.
%  Keep it tidy enough to hand over.
%
%  CONVENTIONS
%    - keys are authorlastname + year + firstword, all lowercase
%    - every entry carries a DOI where one exists
%    - the "openaccess" note field is set ONLY where the publisher version
%      is free to read. An author copy on a personal page is not open
%      access; say "author copy" instead. The \oa badge in the text is
%      driven by this field, and mislabelling it teaches the wrong lesson.
%
%  STATUS: link-checked 2 September 2026. Every DOI was resolved against the
%  OpenAlex/Unpaywall record and every "openaccess" note re-derived from it:
%  gold, diamond, hybrid and bronze all mean the published version is free on
%  the publisher's own site and keep the badge; "green" means a repository
%  copy only and is labelled "author copy"; "closed" gets neither. One DOI was
%  wrong (brand2015beyond) and was corrected. Re-run the check before reuse in
%  a later session -- access status changes under you, usually silently.
%=====================================================================

